span><b>Booked by</b><br>Jaymes Paolo Rombaoa<br><a href=\"mailto:jaymesrombaoa@gmail.com\">jaymesrombaoa@gmail.com</a><br><br><b>Please share anything that will help prepare for our meeting.</b><br>Question about Avicenna features, more customization options for notifications. What if you have groups of participants (e.g., 2-3 members of a family) and want the notifications to be semi-random, but exactly the same for these 3 people?<p>Other Qs about customizing UI/UX — can there be more than 1 Question per screen?</p></span></div></td></tr>\n</table></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" align=\"center\" style=\"width:100%;\"><tbody><tr><td style=\" padding: 0; text-align: left;padding:4px 12px;\" align=\"left\"><div style=\"color: #70757a;\">\n<p>Powered by <a href=\"https://workspace.google.com/resources/appointment-scheduling/\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" title=\"https://workspace.google.com/resources/appointment-scheduling/\" target=\"_blank\">Google Calendar appointment scheduling</a>. Use is subject to the <a href=\"https://policies.google.com/privacy\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" title=\"https://policies.google.com/privacy\" target=\"_blank\">Google Privacy Policy</a> and <a href=\"https://policies.google.com/terms\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" title=\"https://policies.google.com/terms\" target=\"_blank\">Terms of Service</a>.</p>\n<p>You are receiving this email because you are included on the guest list for this booked appointment.</p>\n<p>Forwarding this invitation could allow any recipient to cancel on your behalf.</p>\n</div></td></tr></tbody></table>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>",
